<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vodafone raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vodafone raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Vodafone Group Plc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- NYSE-listed shares closed at 34.</p>
</text>
